          <p class="lead-text">
            Have a business idea but don't know where to start? Join an interactive masterclass designed to help you explore your ideas, understand business fundamentals, discuss your doubts, and find a clearer direction for your next steps.
          </p>

          <!-- CTAs -->
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="/checkout" class="btn btn-primary" id="heroPrimaryCta">
              Claim Your Seat for ₹199
