  <!-- ==============================================================================
       SECTION 2: THE PROBLEM
       ============================================================================== -->
  <section class="section section-dark" id="the-problem">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">THE REALITY OF STARTING UP</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">An Idea Is a Start. Knowing What to Do Next Is the Real Challenge.</h2>
        <p class="body-text" style="font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto;">
          Turning an early concept into a viable venture requires more than enthusiasm. Aspiring founders face real hurdles before taking their first step.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="problem-grid">
        <div class="problem-card">
          <div class="problem-icon-wrapper">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="problem-card-title">Multiple Ideas, Little Direction</h3>
          <p class="problem-card-text">
            Having multiple ideas but not knowing which to pursue or prioritize based on your strengths and resources.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="problem-card">
          <div class="problem-icon-wrapper">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="problem-card-title">Customer Uncertainty</h3>
          <p class="problem-card-text">
            Being unsure about finding the right customers and understanding if they genuinely need what you want to build.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="problem-card">
          <div class="problem-icon-wrapper">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="problem-card-title">Risking Capital Blindly</h3>
          <p class="problem-card-text">
            Not knowing how to validate an idea before investing hard-earned savings, time, and emotional energy.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="problem-card">
          <div class="problem-icon-wrapper">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"></polyline></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="problem-card-title">Conflicting Advice Overload</h3>
          <p class="problem-card-text">
            Feeling overwhelmed by conflicting business advice on social media that lacks context for early-stage beginnings.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="problem-card">
          <div class="problem-icon-wrapper">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="9" y1="3" x2="9" y2="21"></line></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="problem-card-title">Execution Paralysis</h3>
          <p class="problem-card-text">
            Struggling to turn a promising conceptual idea into a grounded, step-by-step practical action plan.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

